## 🚨 Troubleshooting

### AWS CLI Issues
```bash
# Reset AWS config
aws configure list-profiles
aws configure --profile admin

# Check credentials
aws sts get-caller-identity --profile admin
```

### Terraform Issues
```bash
# Reset Terraform state
rm -rf .terraform*
terraform init

# Debug mode
TF_LOG=DEBUG terraform apply
```

### Docker Issues
```bash
# Check Docker daemon
sudo systemctl status docker
sudo systemctl restart docker

# Clean up
docker system prune -a
```

### Kubernetes Issues
```bash
# Reset Minikube
minikube delete
minikube start

# Check cluster
kubectl cluster-info
kubectl get nodes
```

